---
/**
 * PwaInstallPrompt.astro
 * Smart, Non-Intrusive Progressive Web App (PWA) Installation Prompt.
 * 
 * Features:
 * - Desktop Web: Floating compact card in bottom-right corner, non-blocking, above BMC widget.
 * - Mobile Web: Native-feeling bottom sheet with drag handle, safe-area padding, no full-screen overlay.
 * - Smart Engagement Trigger: Only displays after meaningful actions (tab exploration, template downloads, calculators, expense logging).
 * - Real PWA Installation: Uses beforeinstallprompt when supported, fallback instructions for iOS/Safari/desktop.
 * - Frequency & Dismissal Management: 7-day cooldown on dismissal, permanent suppression when installed.
 * - Zero Dependencies: Vanilla JS + Tailwind CSS, lightweight CSS transitions, respects prefers-reduced-motion.
 */
